# Accepted vulnerability exceptions — single source of truth.
#
# Consumed by:
#   - Trivy (natively, in CI and scripts/security/scan-trivy.sh)
#   - scripts/security/scan-dependencies.sh (parses CVE-*/GHSA-* lines to
#     filter bun audit output)
#
# For each accepted finding, list the CVE id (matched by Trivy) AND the GHSA
# id (matched against bun audit output) when both exist, each on its own
# line, with a justification comment. Remove entries as soon as a fix is
# applied.
#
# Currently empty: the dependency tree has no unfixed high/critical findings.
